; A tag wrapping a prelude constant (`#6.11(true)`, and likewise nil/false or parenthesized true)
; uses the same nominal singleton representation as tagged literals. The singleton's direct codecs
; own the tag, inner fixed-value check, and preserve-encoding sidecars. This is the prelude route;
; tagged_literal.cddl covers the literal route.
t = #6.11(true)
